    "title": "Embedded Systems Architecture",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20347854",
    "publication_date": "2026-05-22",
    "description": "<p>Arkhe-Kernel is a hybrid microkernel &mdash; neither a pure microkernel (like seL4) nor a monolith (like Linux), but a<br>\"secure monolith with microkernel islands\". Critical services (scheduler, IPC, memory manager) run in privileged<br>kernel space. Untrusted drivers, AI models, and applications run in \"substrate sandboxes\" in user space, with<br>capability-based access control.</p>",
